TEXT 32 488 Left 2 ;NMOS current mirror: M2 copies the 10 uA that IREF forces through the diode-connected M1.\nLong channels (L = 4 um) give a high output resistance; at 27 C the copy is 9.7 uA at 0.3 V, 10.3 uA at 0.6 V and 11.1 uA at 1.2 V on the output.
